+  //    sorts internally). horizon==pc_offset() for the per-emit check; block-end+margin
+  //    for a pre-block drain.
+  //  * BOUND (target already known): ALWAYS drained here (no deadline -- there is no
+  //    reason to wait; emitting the island ASAP keeps it in the code section, before
+  //    any metadata). Resolved directly (literal set + placeholder patched).
