+      // form. Scratch is SELF-CONTAINED (no global r9 reservation): when the
+      // destination is a free GPR distinct from the source, materialise into it;
+      // otherwise borrow a caller temp with push/pop around this data-processing
+      // op (no sp-relative access, so the transient sp shift is invisible).
+      //
+      // FLAGS: the register form with an implicit LSL #0 sets N/Z from the result
+      // (identical to the A32 immediate form) and, for the ARITHMETIC opcodes
+      // (ADD/SUB/CMP/CMN/RSB/ADC/SBC/RSC), C/V from the ALU -- also identical, so
+      // those are exact. For the LOGICAL opcodes (AND/EOR/ORR/BIC/TST/TEQ/MVN) the
+      // A32 immediate form would set C = value<31> (a non-ThumbExpandable value
+      // has a non-zero rotation), whereas the LSL #0 register form leaves C
+      // unchanged. This is sound for the code V8 emits: V8 consumes C only after
+      // an arithmetic comparison (the cs/cc/hi/ls sites all follow CMP/CMN/SUB/ADD
+      // SetCC), and always follows a logical flag-setting op (tst/teq/ands...) with
+      // a Z- or N-based condition (eq/ne/mi/pl), never a C-based one -- the
+      // shifter-carry of a logical op is dead. (If a future consumer read that C,
+      // this case would need the value<31> materialised explicitly.)
+      {
+        // A binary logical op (AND/EOR/ORR/BIC/TST/TEQ) sets C from the shifter
